---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Eventina Organisers"
  description="Official Privacy Policy of Eventina Organisers — How we handle client consultations, enquiry data, and DPDP Act compliance."
  canonicalURL="https://eventina.in/privacy"
>
  <!-- Hero Banner -->
  <section class="page-hero-compact" style="padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); background: var(--color-navy-950); color: var(--color-text-inverse); text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 146, 66, 0.2);">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-gold-400); display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Legal &amp; Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="page-title" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem); color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-inverse-muted); font-family: var(--font-eyebrow); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase;">
        Last updated: October 2026 &bull; Compliant with Indian DPDP Act and International Standards
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Legal Body Content -->
  <section class="section legal-content-section">
    <div class="container container-prose" style="max-width: 820px; margin-inline: auto;">
      <div class="legal-card-body card" style="padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-cream-200); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); line-height: 1.8;">
        
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          1. Introduction &amp; Scope
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          Eventina Organisers ("Eventina", "we", "us", or "our") respects the sanctity of your private personal details. As premier bespoke event planners in India, this Privacy Policy explains how we collect, process, safeguard, and retain information gathered through our digital website (<a href="https://eventina.in" style="color: var(--color-gold-700); text-decoration: underline;">https://eventina.in</a>), consultation sessions, enquiry forms, and related hospitality services.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          To orchestrate flawless celebratory experiences and destination gatherings, we may collect the following categories of data:
        </p>
        <ul style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-6); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
          <li><strong>Identity &amp; Contact Information:</strong> Full name, telephone number, email address, mailing address, and WhatsApp contact details.</li>
          <li><strong>Event Specifications:</strong> Anticipated celebration dates, selected city/venues, guest count estimates, budget parameters, and curated event preferences.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical &amp; Analytical Identifiers:</strong> Anonymised IP addresses, browser variants, operating platforms, and device telemetries collected via Google Analytics 4 (GA4).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          3. Purpose and Legal Grounds of Processing
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          We process your personal information strictly for legitimate commercial requirements, including:
        </p>
        <ul style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-6); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
          <li>Reviewing enquiry proposals and formulating customized quotations.</li>
          <li>Direct correspondence regarding venue availabilities, artist curation, and logistical milestones.</li>
          <li>Complying with statutory reporting requirements under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act).</li>
          <li>Ensuring seamless user interaction across our web pages via safe telemetry.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          4. Data Storage &amp; Security Measures
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          Form submissions and lead communications are stored securely in encrypted databases hosted on enterprise-grade Cloudflare infrastructure with strict role-based access. We do not sell, rent, monetize, or barter client data to third-party commercial marketing brokers.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          5. Your Rights as a Data Principal
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          Under applicable Indian data protection frameworks, you maintain the entitlement to:
        </p>
        <ul style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-6); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
          <li>Request verification of information stored in our records.</li>
          <li>Seek rectification of inaccurate or outdated identifiers.</li>
          <li>Request erasure of past enquiry records where continuous retention is no longer legally mandated.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0;">
          For data rights queries, email our Data Representative at <a href="mailto:Eventinapvtltd@gmail.com" style="color: var(--color-gold-700); text-decoration: underline;">Eventinapvtltd@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
